"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in M\\)</span> (forcing notion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{\\mathbb P}\">\\(M^{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>-names over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi\\)</span> (forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\\)</span> (forcing-notion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (countable transitive ground-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AddsReal}\">\\(\\operatorname{AddsReal}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}adds\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\operatorname{AddsReal}(M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\exists\\dot x\\in M^{\\mathbb P}\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\dot x\\in\\check{\\omega^\\omega}\\land\\forall y\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\dot x\\neq\\check y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}adds\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\operatorname{AddsReal}(M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\exists\\dot x\\in M^{\\mathbb P}\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\dot x\\in\\check{\\omega^\\omega}\\land\\forall y\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\dot x\\neq\\check y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The name is forced to differ from every ground-model real, not merely to be outside an ill-typed check-name for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The forcing triple is unpacked inside the predicate, and the ground model is witnessed by the registered countable-transitive-model predicate before the relativized forcing relation is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md","status":"resolved","id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M^{\\mathbb P}$ (class of $\\mathbb P$-names over $M$, see [[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi$ (forcing relation, see [[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md","status":"resolved","id":"d413862f4ab047c8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S$ (forcing-notion predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]])","embed"